{
  "id": "reversing-mod-linking",
  "workdir": "/home/student/task",
  "hostname": "lab",
  "expect": {
    "file": "/home/student/task/found.txt",
    "contains": "nto{dyn4m1c_l1nk3r_n33ds_l1bc}"
  },
  "fs": [
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task",
      "type": "dir"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/task.md",
      "text": "# Задача: динамическая vs статическая компоновка\n\nДва бинаря: `dyn` и `stat`.\n\n1. `file dyn stat` — сравни `dynamically linked` / `statically linked`.\n2. `readelf -d dyn` — динамическая секция; какая библиотека в NEEDED?\n3. `readelf -d stat` — у статического динамической секции нет.\n4. Флаг лежит в `dyn` — `strings dyn | grep nto`.\n\nФлаг запиши в `found.txt` и набери `check`.\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/dyn",
      "b64": "",
      "mode": "755"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/stat",
      "b64": "",
      "mode": "755"
    }
  ],
  "tools": {
    "readelf": {
      "help": "readelf <опция> <файл> — разбор ELF",
      "cases": [
        {
          "match": "-d\\s+stat",
          "example": "readelf -d stat",
          "output": "\nThere is no dynamic section in this file.\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "-d\\s+dyn|dynamic",
          "example": "readelf -d dyn",
          "output": "\nDynamic section at offset 0x2f30 contains 8 entries:\n  Tag        Type                         Name/Value\n 0x0000000000000001 (NEEDED)             Shared library: [libc.so.6]\n 0x000000006ffffef5 (GNU_HASH)           0x4002e8\n 0x0000000000000005 (STRTAB)             0x400320\n 0x0000000000000006 (SYMTAB)             0x400308\n 0x000000000000000a (STRSZ)              11 (bytes)\n 0x000000000000000b (SYMENT)             24 (bytes)\n 0x0000000000000015 (DEBUG)              0x0\n 0x0000000000000000 (NULL)               0x0\n"
